  - sourcedata/: the published versions of the files whose values change in this version (7 channels.tsv), byte-identical at the same relative path (plain git files)
  - README.md: new section "Contributed notes (version 1.0.2)"
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.0.0 -> 1.0.2
